ex:C021P0063 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 14320 ;
    ct:exact_text "in a breach of any provisions of, constitute a default (or an event which, with notice or lapse of time, or both, would constitute a default) under, result in the termination of, accelerate the performance required by, or result in a right of termination or acceleration or the creation of any Lien upon any of the properties or assets of Freedom Mortgage under any of the terms, conditions or provisions of any material contract to which Freedom Mortgage is a party, or by which it or any of its properties or assets may be bound or affected." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/CHERRYHILLMORTGAGEINVESTMENTCORP_09_26_2013-EX-10.1-Strategic Alliance Agreement.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "2528d4f273fad72ea608329997b95e96626632b3936a93a32dd0bbad5db970cd" ;
    ct:start_char 13777 .

ex:C021P0077 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 20362 ;
    ct:exact_text "(b) In the event that a party materially breaches any representation or covenant herein, the other party may give written notice of the breach requiring the same to be remedied within 30 days of receipt of such notice. If the breaching party fails to remedy the material breach in such time period, the non-breaching party may terminate this Agreement by delivery of a written termination notice to the breaching party. Any such termination shall not relieve the breaching party from any obligation or liability arising prior to such termination." ;
    ct:source_path "cuad/CHERRYHILLMORTGAGEINVESTMENTCORP_09_26_2013-EX-10.1-Strategic Alliance Agreement.txt" ;
    ct:source_sha256 "2528d4f273fad72ea608329997b95e96626632b3936a93a32dd0bbad5db970cd" ;
    ct:start_char 19816 .

