    ct:description "(d) The Purchase Agreement will provide that Freedom Mortgage will indemnify Cherry Hill against, and hold it harmless from, any loss, cost or expense incurred by Cherry Hill as a result of Ginnie Mae's termination for cause of Freedom Mortgage as an issuer." ;
    ct:supported_by ex:C021P0054 ;
    meta:review_status "UNREVIEWED" .

